  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO will facilitate participation of the Employer and Business Membership Organizations of Armenia in preparation of the new Law on employers&#x2019; organizations to ensure legitimacy of the process as well as due consideration of their interests. EBMOs will be assisted in implementing the new law in practice and securing restoration of the freedom of association for the employers as well as the transparency of the process. Expansion of membership and representativeness in line with the new law will be also supported.</narrative>
  </description>
